{
  "description": "The creature is a four-legged equid shown in full right-facing profile against a plain off-white background, with a donkey-like body and head combined with zebra-like striping. Its coat is dusty brown-gray with a pale off-white underbelly and muzzle, and dark brown to black stripes across the hindquarters, back, sides, neck, chest and legs. It has a slender, slightly sway-backed torso, a long neck, a donkey-shaped head with a white nose and mouth area, two large upright ears, a short stiff upright mane along the top of the neck, four slender legs ending in single hooves, and a thin tail with a dark tuft at the tip. The rendering is detailed and naturalistic with fine fur texture.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "donkey-shaped head in right profile with brown fur on the face and forehead, white fur around the nostrils, mouth and chin, a dark eye with a thin light eye-ring, a large dark nostril, and short whiskers on the lower lip and chin",
      "where": "at the front end of the neck, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed donkey ears with brown outer fur and lighter inner fur with dark shading inside the ear cavity",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly in front of the other"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, bristly upright mane with alternating dark and light bands giving a striped, spiky appearance",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender equid legs with short fur, brown-gray above fading to pale off-white on the lower forelegs and hindlegs, with dark horizontal zebra-like banding especially on the lower portions and around the joints",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the hips, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four single-toed, rounded hooves, dark gray-brown with a hard cap and slight point at the front, with a small fetlock tuft above each",
      "where": "at the bottom tip of each leg"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "thin donkey-like tail with short brown fur along its length and a longer, darker brown-black hair tuft at the tip",
      "where": "extending from the rear of the rump, hanging down behind the hindlegs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "dark brown-black zebra-like stripes: diagonal to vertical stripes on the hindquarters, torso and lower neck, a thin dark dorsal stripe along the spine, a prominent dark shoulder stripe encircling the base of the neck, and horizontal bands on the legs and chest; stripes are densest on the rear half and legs",
      "where": "across the hindquarters, back, sides, neck, chest and legs, with the palest unstriped area on the belly"
    }
  ],
